There is a way to (partially) do this.
You may modify any level with a pickaxe.  You can also drop some interesting
things here and there, and summon some interesting monsters with cursed scrolls
of genocide.  However, you will have to give your life if you want the level
to be accessible for others, in the form of a bones file...
